      "title": "AuK — models and setup",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "7.8",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## AuK models\n\nDownload one diffusion model, one Qwen encoder and the VAE. Mix precisions if needed. Sizes below are disk GB, not VRAM requirements.\n\n| Model | BF16 | INT8 ConvRot | W4A8 ConvRot |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Base | [3.062 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_base_bf16.safetensors?download=true) | [1.546 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_base_int8.safetensors?download=true) | [0.880 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_base_w4a8.safetensors?download=true) |\n| Flash | [3.062 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_flash_bf16.safetensors?download=true) | [1.546 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_flash_int8.safetensors?download=true) | [0.880 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_flash_w4a8.safetensors?download=true) |\n| Qwen encoder | [8.070 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen_omni_bf16.safetensors?download=true) | [4.669 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen_omni_int8.safetensors?download=true) | [3.179 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen_omni_w4a8.safetensors?download=true) |\n\n[VAE: 0.637 GB, unquantized](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/vae/auk_vae.safetensors?download=true)\n\n## Model folders\n\n```text\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   └── auk_base_w4a8.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen_omni_int8.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── auk_vae.safetensors\n```\n\nThe filenames above are the ones this workflow selects; other formats work, select your installed files in the loaders. Qwen config/tokenizer files are bundled with the node pack; only download weights.\n\n## Settings\n\n- Base: 32 steps, guidance 2, sway -1.\n- Flash: fixed four steps, no guidance; ignores those controls.\n- Compute precision: auto. Quantization comes from the checkpoint.\n- Attention: auto follows ComfyUI; explicit Flash/Sage fall back to SDPA when incompatible or masked.\n- Output: mono 24 kHz.\n- Reference/source audio plus the generated target share one 30-second budget; trim longer clips first.\n\n[Task guide with examples](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-AuK/blob/main/docs/GUIDE.md) · [Report an issue](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-AuK/issues)"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## AuK models\n\nDownload one diffusion model, one Qwen encoder and the VAE. Mix precisions if needed. Sizes below are disk GB, not VRAM requirements.\n\n| Model | BF16 | INT8 ConvRot | W4A8 ConvRot |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Base | [3.062 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_base_bf16.safetensors?download=true) | [1.546 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_base_int8.safetensors?download=true) | [0.880 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_base_w4a8.safetensors?download=true) |\n| Flash | [3.062 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_flash_bf16.safetensors?download=true) | [1.546 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_flash_int8.safetensors?download=true) | [0.880 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/diffusion_models/auk_flash_w4a8.safetensors?download=true) |\n| Qwen encoder | [8.070 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen_omni_bf16.safetensors?download=true) | [4.669 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen_omni_int8.safetensors?download=true) | [3.179 GB](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen_omni_w4a8.safetensors?download=true) |\n\n[VAE: 0.637 GB, unquantized](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/AuK-comfyui/resolve/main/vae/auk_vae.safetensors?download=true)\n\n## Model folders\n\n```text\n📂 ComfyUI/\n└── 📂 models/\n    ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n    │   └── auk_base_w4a8.safetensors\n    ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n    │   └── qwen_omni_int8.safetensors\n    └── 📂 vae/\n        └── auk_vae.safetensors\n```\n\nThe filenames above are the ones this workflow selects; other formats work, select your installed files in the loaders. Qwen config/tokenizer files are bundled with the node pack; only download weights.\n\n## Settings\n\n- Base: 32 steps, guidance 2, sway -1.\n- Flash: fixed four steps, no guidance; ignores those controls.\n- Compute precision: auto. Quantization comes from the checkpoint.\n- Attention: auto follows ComfyUI; explicit Flash/Sage fall back to SDPA when incompatible or masked.\n- Output: mono 24 kHz.\n- Reference/source audio plus the generated target share one 30-second budget; trim longer clips first.\n\n[Task guide with examples](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-AuK/blob/main/docs/GUIDE.md) · [Report an issue](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-AuK/issues)"
